Generate the file "defects/defect_report.json" capturing exactly 8 validation defects discovered during test execution, ensuring at least 2 defects per module.

Structure each defect with these exact fields:
- defect_id
- module (Login, Ticket Booking, Enquiry)
- user_story_id
- entered_data (what was entered)
- actual_behavior (what happened)
- expected_result (what should have happened)
- severity (Critical, Major, Minor)
- priority (High, Medium, Low)

Ensure defects reflect genuine missing client-side validation rules (e.g., booking accepting invalid email formats, non-numeric phone numbers, negative passenger count decrement, message submitted with under 15 characters, case sensitivity bypass in captcha). Output pure JSON.
